WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:42.840
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:43.110 --> 01:48.009
[When I Meet The Moon]

3
01:48.070 --> 01:51.200
[Episode 3]

4
01:52.370 --> 01:54.000
Has the passphrase been changed?

5
01:54.000 --> 01:55.090
I'll call Xia.

6
01:55.090 --> 01:55.900
Try again.

7
01:58.070 --> 01:58.930
Come on.

8
02:01.370 --> 02:02.570
Puppy, open the door.

9
02:02.840 --> 02:03.840
Louder.

10
02:08.430 --> 02:09.310
Puppy...

11
02:36.180 --> 02:37.840
W-Why are you here?

12
02:39.340 --> 02:40.470
Shouldn't I be here?

13
02:44.650 --> 02:45.210
Uncle,

14
02:45.300 --> 02:46.630
has the lock been fixed?

15
02:47.870 --> 02:48.500
Yeah.

16
02:50.770 --> 02:52.000
-Little Kid? -Old Auntie?

17
02:52.000 --> 02:54.000
-Why are you here? -Why are you here?

18
02:56.440 --> 02:57.570
Tangy, you're here.

19
03:00.000 --> 03:00.800
What's wrong?

20
03:00.840 --> 03:01.870
What happened?

21
03:02.010 --> 03:03.810
-Something's wrong. -Nothing.

22
03:04.340 --> 03:05.390
You know each other?

23
03:05.390 --> 03:06.200
-No. -Yes.

24
03:09.130 --> 03:10.590
You guys are quite in sync.

25
03:10.840 --> 03:12.100
Tangy, don't mind him.

26
03:12.300 --> 03:13.900
My brother is just like this.

27
03:14.970 --> 03:16.579
It's a small world.

28
03:16.840 --> 03:19.280
I won't stoop to a little kid's level.

29
03:21.240 --> 03:22.370
I won't stoop to

30
03:22.370 --> 03:23.680
an old auntie's level either.

31
03:23.680 --> 03:24.470
You...

32
03:25.310 --> 03:26.870
Alright, whether you know each other or not,

33
03:26.870 --> 03:28.470
let me make an introduction.

34
03:28.710 --> 03:29.180
Hello,

35
03:29.180 --> 03:30.240
I'm Xia Congsheng.

36
03:30.470 --> 03:31.530
You must be Yun Li.

37
03:31.530 --> 03:33.260
I often hear Tangy mention you.

38
03:34.130 --> 03:34.930
Hello.

39
03:35.400 --> 03:36.280
This is my brother,

40
03:36.280 --> 03:37.079
Fu Zhengchu.

41
03:38.120 --> 03:39.090
We met at the airport,

42
03:39.090 --> 03:39.750
remember?

43
03:40.590 --> 03:41.970
Sorry about last time.

44
03:42.400 --> 03:43.579
I misunderstood you.

45
03:43.579 --> 03:44.370
It's fine.

46
03:44.530 --> 03:46.060
You two know each other too?

47
03:46.300 --> 03:47.090
Well...

48
03:47.300 --> 03:48.530
The guy playing cool just now

49
03:48.530 --> 03:49.840
is my uncle, Fu Shize.

50
03:49.870 --> 03:50.680
Fu Shize?

51
03:51.130 --> 03:52.090
Isn't he your...

52
03:52.090 --> 03:52.430
Please,

53
03:52.430 --> 03:53.630
d-don't say any more.

54
03:57.660 --> 04:00.320
You look like you're the same age.

55
04:00.340 --> 04:02.630
How could he be your uncle?

56
04:02.870 --> 04:03.690
We're about the same age,

57
04:03.690 --> 04:04.500
but my uncle's side

58
04:04.500 --> 04:05.500
is senior to ours.

59
04:07.190 --> 04:07.970
Let's go inside.

60
04:07.970 --> 04:09.470
Don't just stand here chatting.

61
04:09.470 --> 04:10.180
Let's go in.

62
04:11.130 --> 04:11.990
Please come in.

63
04:12.470 --> 04:13.000
Let's go.

64
04:14.080 --> 04:15.400
Don't follow me.

65
04:16.690 --> 04:17.480
How is it?

66
04:17.480 --> 04:18.100
Not bad, right?

67
04:18.100 --> 04:19.300
My little courtyard.

68
04:24.070 --> 04:24.870
Xia,

69
04:24.930 --> 04:26.240
what were you doing?

70
04:27.800 --> 04:29.330
I was making crepe rolls,

71
04:29.430 --> 04:31.080
but they're too hard to make.

72
04:31.110 --> 04:33.490
I've been trying all morning and haven't gotten anywhere.

73
04:33.490 --> 04:34.170
Our Lili

74
04:34.190 --> 04:35.620
is an expert in this.

75
04:36.100 --> 04:36.690
Show her.

76
04:39.680 --> 04:42.100
You overwhipped the egg whites.

77
04:42.100 --> 04:44.300
And if the crepe breaks like this,

78
04:44.300 --> 04:46.270
the pan might be too hot,

79
04:46.270 --> 04:48.130
or the crepe has been overcooked.

80
04:48.180 --> 04:49.110
Let me have a try.

81
04:49.180 --> 04:49.980
Uncle,

82
04:50.070 --> 04:52.130
don't forget to fix the air purifier.

83
04:54.420 --> 04:56.060
♪ I grew used to ♪

84
04:56.090 --> 04:59.490
♪ Keeping a polite distance ♪

85
04:57.260 --> 04:58.370
L-Let me have a try.

86
04:58.560 --> 04:59.040
Okay.

87
05:01.470 --> 05:03.680
♪ Until you came along ♪

88
05:03.870 --> 05:07.460
♪ And messed up all my logic ♪

89
05:09.260 --> 05:11.440
♪ I once thought it through carefully ♪

90
05:11.480 --> 05:15.730
♪ The breath drawn as I lean in on purpose ♪

91
05:16.800 --> 05:18.550
♪ When I stand right beside you ♪

92
05:18.580 --> 05:23.150
♪ Even silence starts to mean something ♪

93
05:24.760 --> 05:27.710
♪ I know those fears ♪

94
05:27.730 --> 05:31.070
♪ May never truly fade away ♪

95
05:32.480 --> 05:35.120
♪ Still I choose to stay ♪

96
05:35.140 --> 05:38.150
♪ On your page ♪

97
05:40.390 --> 05:42.100
♪ It's you ♪

98
05:42.190 --> 05:44.400
♪ Even with my eyes closed ♪

99
05:44.430 --> 05:45.580
♪ Just you ♪

100
05:45.610 --> 05:48.270
♪ Are the instinct I can't quit ♪

101
05:48.370 --> 05:49.750
♪ It's always you ♪

102
05:49.770 --> 05:52.090
♪ Brings faded colors back to life ♪

103
05:52.120 --> 05:55.380
♪ And keeps me company through the endless night ♪

104
05:53.330 --> 05:54.130
Lili,

105
05:54.630 --> 05:55.540
your crepe rolls

106
05:55.540 --> 05:57.070
look so beautiful!

107
05:56.080 --> 05:57.450
♪ It's you ♪

108
05:57.470 --> 05:59.450
♪ Even if I forget everything ♪

109
05:58.570 --> 05:59.740
Our Lili is an expert

110
05:59.470 --> 06:00.700
♪ Just you ♪

111
05:59.740 --> 06:00.800
in this field.

112
06:00.720 --> 06:03.700
♪ All my heart defaults to ♪

113
06:01.240 --> 06:02.100
Besides crepe rolls,

114
06:02.100 --> 06:04.190
she can make a lot of other desserts.

115
06:03.720 --> 06:04.670
♪ It's always you ♪

116
06:04.330 --> 06:05.300
Amazing.

117
06:04.690 --> 06:05.760
♪ Even the most ordinary seasons ♪

118
06:05.630 --> 06:06.570
My job

119
06:05.790 --> 06:08.480
♪ Every ordinary season ♪

120
06:06.570 --> 06:08.700
is to learn a little bit of everything.

121
06:09.340 --> 06:12.230
♪ It's you ♪

122
06:10.180 --> 06:11.310
It looks delicious!

123
06:15.570 --> 06:16.370
It's tasty!

124
06:17.500 --> 06:18.480
It's really good.

125
06:18.480 --> 06:20.540
Better than the ones bought in stores.

126
06:20.540 --> 06:21.330
Really?

127
06:23.770 --> 06:25.070
How did you two meet?

128
06:26.830 --> 06:27.800
When I went back to Nanwu,

129
06:27.800 --> 06:29.390
I bumped into Lili at the airport.

130
06:29.390 --> 06:30.370
I asked her to add me on WeChat,

131
06:30.370 --> 06:31.740
but she turned me down.

132
06:31.780 --> 06:33.600
I told her that EAW

133
06:33.630 --> 06:35.100
was run by Qingsong.

134
06:35.130 --> 06:36.590
But she didn't believe me.

135
06:37.070 --> 06:40.370
So Mr. Xu is really your brother?

136
06:41.000 --> 06:42.430
We are sort of relatives.

137
06:42.570 --> 06:43.300
My great-aunt

138
06:43.300 --> 06:45.300
is Qingsong's adoptive godmother.

139
06:45.370 --> 06:46.180
Uncle,

140
06:46.180 --> 06:46.690
it's delicious.

141
06:46.690 --> 06:47.430
Have a try.

142
06:58.600 --> 06:59.200
Is it good?

143
07:02.920 --> 07:03.930
-I told you it's delicious. -Lili,

144
07:03.930 --> 07:05.130
come over often when you're free,

145
07:05.130 --> 07:07.060
so I can learn a few skills from you.

146
07:08.800 --> 07:10.300
She's here to do a shop tour video.

147
07:10.300 --> 07:11.700
How could she come often?

148
07:11.770 --> 07:12.430
Lili is going

149
07:12.430 --> 07:14.290
to study for her master's at NUST.

150
07:14.300 --> 07:15.500
She's not going back.

151
07:15.740 --> 07:16.540
Lili,

152
07:17.130 --> 07:18.180
we are alumni.

153
07:18.440 --> 07:19.970
You should call her Senior.

154
07:20.120 --> 07:21.240
That would sound too distant,

155
07:21.240 --> 07:22.120
right, Lili?

156
07:24.570 --> 07:26.420
Have you found a place to live?

157
07:26.770 --> 07:27.630
Not yet.

158
07:27.740 --> 07:28.920
Tangy and I are planning

159
07:28.920 --> 07:30.330
to go house-hunting tomorrow.

160
07:30.330 --> 07:31.760
Why bother looking for a place?

161
07:31.760 --> 07:32.900
I have so many rooms here.

162
07:32.900 --> 07:34.590
Just pick one and move in.

163
07:35.740 --> 07:37.540
Xia, stop joking.

164
07:37.720 --> 07:39.120
Lili is still a student

165
07:39.120 --> 07:40.380
and doesn't have a job.

166
07:40.390 --> 07:41.780
Living here long-term,

167
07:41.870 --> 07:43.370
she won't be able to afford it.

168
07:43.370 --> 07:44.970
I'll give you a 50% discount.

169
07:45.810 --> 07:47.240
I don't think that's a good idea.

170
07:47.240 --> 07:48.070
It's okay.

171
07:48.310 --> 07:49.050
Just move in.

172
07:49.070 --> 07:49.810
Consider it

173
07:49.810 --> 07:51.220
tuition for teaching me

174
07:51.220 --> 07:52.070
how to make desserts.

175
07:52.070 --> 07:53.510
No, I can't.

176
07:53.510 --> 07:54.510
It's really okay.

177
07:54.570 --> 07:56.240
Don't worry about the money.

178
07:56.240 --> 07:57.370
You can pay me back slowly

179
07:57.370 --> 07:58.830
after you find a job.

180
07:59.620 --> 08:01.040
Since Xia said so,

181
08:01.040 --> 08:02.220
just stay here.

182
08:04.830 --> 08:06.630
Then thank you, Xia.

183
08:06.630 --> 08:07.540
Once I get an internship,

184
08:07.540 --> 08:08.930
I'll pay the rent.

185
08:08.930 --> 08:10.040
It's fine. No rush.

186
08:11.240 --> 08:11.750
Great.

187
08:12.270 --> 08:12.810
Lili,

188
08:12.810 --> 08:13.480
if you live here,

189
08:13.480 --> 08:13.870
we can

190
08:13.870 --> 08:14.930
go to school together.

191
08:14.930 --> 08:16.130
What's so good about it?

192
08:16.130 --> 08:17.270
I'm warning you,

193
08:17.510 --> 08:18.720
people like you who hit on girls

194
08:18.720 --> 08:20.010
and ask for their WeChat

195
08:20.010 --> 08:21.270
should stay away from our Lili.

196
08:21.270 --> 08:23.100
I'd call this fate with Lili.

197
08:25.100 --> 08:26.270
You're destined to cross paths

198
08:26.270 --> 08:27.430
with every pretty girl.

199
08:27.430 --> 08:28.330
Xia Congsheng,

200
08:29.120 --> 08:30.010
when Sang Zhi and I

201
08:30.010 --> 08:30.930
had our parents called in,

202
08:30.930 --> 08:32.370
you thought her brother was handsome

203
08:32.370 --> 08:34.429
and asked for his WeChat, didn't you?

204
08:35.530 --> 08:37.059
Why are you bringing him up?

205
08:44.620 --> 08:46.120
Speaking of WeChat,

206
08:46.820 --> 08:47.510
our Lili

207
08:47.510 --> 08:49.130
has never taken the initiative

208
08:49.130 --> 08:50.940
to ask for someone's WeChat.

209
08:54.940 --> 08:57.200
Actually, I have.

210
08:58.650 --> 08:59.750
When?

211
09:00.010 --> 09:01.270
How come I didn't know?

212
09:02.290 --> 09:03.370
Is he handsome?

213
09:08.650 --> 09:09.150
Yeah.

214
09:10.860 --> 09:11.720
Did you add him?

215
09:14.120 --> 09:15.670
No, I didn't.

216
09:16.100 --> 09:17.900
Someone actually rejected you?

217
09:18.040 --> 09:19.010
What happened?

218
09:19.010 --> 09:19.750
Tell us,

219
09:19.750 --> 09:20.880
so we can analyze it.

220
09:21.410 --> 09:22.290
It's nothing.

221
09:22.860 --> 09:24.620
Maybe it's my own problem.

222
09:25.000 --> 09:26.220
How could it be your problem?

223
09:26.220 --> 09:27.820
It must be the guy's problem.

224
09:28.510 --> 09:29.200
How could it be

225
09:29.200 --> 09:30.200
the guy's problem?

226
09:30.200 --> 09:31.530
It must be the girl's...

227
09:34.960 --> 09:36.890
It's definitely the guy's problem.

228
09:36.890 --> 09:38.150
And it's a big problem.

229
09:39.600 --> 09:40.860
A big problem!

230
09:42.200 --> 09:43.790
Maybe it's the first time

231
09:43.790 --> 09:45.100
this guy has been asked

232
09:45.100 --> 09:46.340
for his WeChat by such a pretty girl.

233
09:46.340 --> 09:47.790
He wanted to play hard to get,

234
09:47.790 --> 09:49.590
but now he must be regretting it.

235
09:50.360 --> 09:50.870
Yeah.

236
09:51.580 --> 09:52.240
He must be kicking himself

237
09:52.240 --> 09:53.750
right now.

238
09:55.250 --> 09:56.250
But Lili,

239
09:56.460 --> 09:58.100
could it be because the guy

240
09:58.100 --> 09:59.100
has a girlfriend?

241
10:02.630 --> 10:03.790
Right, Uncle?

242
10:16.620 --> 10:17.530
Is it possible

243
10:18.030 --> 10:19.560
that when he said "No need,"

244
10:22.000 --> 10:23.530
he meant the cold medicine?

245
10:31.100 --> 10:32.340
What cold medicine?

246
10:37.000 --> 10:37.620
How about

247
10:37.620 --> 10:38.820
we add each other now?

248
10:38.940 --> 10:40.540
I promise I won't reject you.

249
10:42.310 --> 10:43.100
Lili.

250
10:44.050 --> 10:45.030
Let me add you on WeChat.

251
10:45.030 --> 10:46.490
I won't reject you either.

252
10:47.210 --> 10:49.050
Haven't we already?

253
10:50.290 --> 10:51.100
Last time,

254
10:51.100 --> 10:52.300
it was my alt account.

255
10:52.700 --> 10:54.030
You have an alt account?

256
10:54.630 --> 10:55.600
Such a player.

257
10:56.500 --> 10:57.960
It's the store's account.

258
10:58.790 --> 11:00.450
You two should add each other.

259
11:00.530 --> 11:01.030
No.

260
11:01.030 --> 11:01.790
No.

261
11:02.200 --> 11:03.000
Uncle.

262
11:03.270 --> 11:04.930
Uncle, you should add her too.

263
11:08.500 --> 11:09.790
Don't bother him.

264
11:09.790 --> 11:11.520
He doesn't like to join the fun.

265
11:41.720 --> 11:43.440
I actually added him.

266
12:09.100 --> 12:09.890
How is it?

267
12:09.960 --> 12:10.890
I'm not bad, am I?

268
12:11.160 --> 12:12.740
You didn't want to go before.

269
12:12.740 --> 12:13.790
Now you are happy.

270
12:14.790 --> 12:16.530
So he wasn't rejecting me.

271
12:16.530 --> 12:18.530
He was rejecting the cold medicine.

272
12:20.030 --> 12:21.250
No wonder.

273
12:21.460 --> 12:23.200
I thought you two looked weird just now.

274
12:23.200 --> 12:25.040
So that's how you two are connected.

275
12:25.040 --> 12:26.100
It's not like that.

276
12:26.100 --> 12:28.390
W-We just chatted a bit, and that's all.

277
12:28.790 --> 12:30.460
That wouldn't be enough.

278
12:31.550 --> 12:32.240
Anyway, now

279
12:32.240 --> 12:33.290
you've added each other on WeChat.

280
12:33.290 --> 12:34.500
Chat more when you are free,

281
12:34.500 --> 12:36.240
and the feelings will grow.

282
12:36.840 --> 12:39.340
In a relationship,

283
12:39.740 --> 12:42.100
the most important thing is communication.

284
12:42.100 --> 12:42.860
You have to chat more.

285
12:42.860 --> 12:43.700
What relationship?

286
12:43.700 --> 12:45.560
How come we're in a relationship?

287
12:45.600 --> 12:46.650
There's nothing to be shy about.

288
12:46.650 --> 12:47.340
This is a big step

289
12:47.340 --> 12:49.250
towards your happiness.

290
12:49.940 --> 12:51.000
Be proactive.

291
12:53.130 --> 12:54.150
I'll try my best.

292
12:54.390 --> 12:55.240
Deal?

293
12:55.960 --> 12:56.600
Deal.

294
12:56.940 --> 12:57.650
Deal.

295
13:07.000 --> 13:07.580
Grandma.

296
13:08.530 --> 13:09.390
Time to eat.

297
13:09.790 --> 13:10.600
Look at you,

298
13:10.600 --> 13:11.790
sweating all over.

299
13:12.000 --> 13:12.790
Wipe it.

300
13:14.790 --> 13:15.940
I have 2 boxes left.

301
13:15.940 --> 13:16.940
I'll finish moving them soon.

302
13:16.940 --> 13:17.860
No rush.

303
13:17.860 --> 13:18.630
Eat first.

304
13:18.630 --> 13:20.560
Move them after you finish eating.

305
13:25.100 --> 13:25.530
Here.

306
13:31.790 --> 13:33.240
Why is it chicken soup?

307
13:33.690 --> 13:35.090
Yuan loves fish.

308
13:41.240 --> 13:42.030
I like both.

309
13:42.890 --> 13:44.220
I like chicken soup too.

310
13:45.740 --> 13:46.010
Here.

311
13:46.010 --> 13:47.070
Thank you, Auntie.

312
13:48.130 --> 13:50.060
It's Shize who loves chicken soup.

313
13:53.080 --> 13:53.740
Why didn't Shize

314
13:53.740 --> 13:55.170
come to eat today?

315
13:55.510 --> 13:56.630
Did you two

316
13:56.840 --> 13:57.750
have a fight?

317
13:59.120 --> 13:59.910
No.

318
14:00.820 --> 14:01.750
We are good.

319
14:05.480 --> 14:06.940
Shize is younger than you.

320
14:07.010 --> 14:08.270
You are older than him.

321
14:08.480 --> 14:09.770
Give in to him more.

322
14:10.250 --> 14:10.820
Mm.

323
14:13.250 --> 14:14.860
Mom, you eat too.

324
14:15.960 --> 14:16.890
I am eating.

325
14:17.150 --> 14:17.930
Here, Grandma,

326
14:17.930 --> 14:18.790
have some fish.

327
14:19.430 --> 14:20.890
Yuan, you're so sensible.

328
14:26.960 --> 14:27.750
I'm full.

329
14:28.460 --> 14:30.120
I'll go to the front and check.

330
14:54.340 --> 14:55.010
Uncle,

331
14:55.750 --> 14:57.150
you'd better drink less.

332
14:57.960 --> 14:59.360
It's bad for your health.

333
15:02.080 --> 15:02.880
In the future,

334
15:03.840 --> 15:05.500
don't come to our house often.

335
15:17.700 --> 15:19.160
Who are you doing this for?

336
15:23.530 --> 15:25.000
No matter how much you do,

337
15:26.000 --> 15:27.550
no one will forgive you!

338
15:33.700 --> 15:34.760
Alright, alright.

339
15:35.030 --> 15:35.790
It's already the end of the month.

340
15:35.790 --> 15:36.940
Go settle the beer bill,

341
15:36.940 --> 15:38.030
will you?

342
15:47.960 --> 15:48.750
Shize,

343
15:49.740 --> 15:51.340
your uncle didn't mean that.

344
15:51.460 --> 15:52.790
Don't take it to heart.

345
15:54.000 --> 15:55.700
Mm, I know.

346
15:56.460 --> 15:58.630
Some things can't be resolved

347
15:58.630 --> 15:59.790
in a day or two.

348
16:00.360 --> 16:01.690
Just give him some time.

349
16:05.790 --> 16:06.480
By the way,

350
16:06.960 --> 16:07.890
remember to give Grandma

351
16:07.890 --> 16:09.150
her medicine on time.

352
16:09.440 --> 16:10.050
I've already transferred

353
16:10.050 --> 16:11.360
the money for this month.

354
16:11.360 --> 16:12.340
Didn't I tell you

355
16:12.340 --> 16:13.530
not to send any more money?

356
16:13.530 --> 16:15.190
I'll go keep Grandma company.

357
16:16.750 --> 16:17.250
Hey.

358
16:21.600 --> 16:22.650
This kid...

359
16:23.750 --> 16:24.360
Mom.

360
16:37.600 --> 16:39.000
I've told you so many times.

361
16:39.000 --> 16:39.600
Leave these chores

362
16:39.600 --> 16:40.790
to me from now on.

363
16:44.080 --> 16:44.870
You and Dad

364
16:44.960 --> 16:46.960
just need to enjoy your retirement.

365
17:28.620 --> 17:29.710
There really is such a thing

366
17:29.710 --> 17:32.200
as the moon falling from the sky.

367
17:37.170 --> 17:38.590
Strange.

368
17:41.000 --> 17:42.460
Not a single daily post.

369
17:44.000 --> 17:46.310
What exactly have you been doing?

370
17:51.530 --> 17:53.670
[EAW Compute Platform]

371
17:51.890 --> 17:53.290
Data connected.

372
17:53.530 --> 17:54.900
Start uploading.

373
18:09.460 --> 18:10.940
Uploading.

374
18:22.810 --> 18:24.610
Data transmission successful.

375
18:31.090 --> 18:31.980
I'm still busy,

376
18:32.110 --> 18:33.330
so I won't go to eat.

377
18:34.410 --> 18:35.720
I can't write my paper,

378
18:35.850 --> 18:37.380
so I'm not in the mood to eat.

379
18:38.740 --> 18:39.160
Yuan,

380
18:39.660 --> 18:41.060
I'll bring you some food.

381
19:04.500 --> 19:05.000
Yuan.

382
19:06.010 --> 19:07.440
You haven't eaten yet, right?

383
19:07.440 --> 19:08.770
Look what I brought you.

384
19:13.740 --> 19:14.400
Try it.

385
19:18.830 --> 19:19.350
Eat.

386
19:29.550 --> 19:32.960
Is Professor Che still rushing you for your paper?

387
19:38.510 --> 19:40.310
Doesn't he know your situation?

388
19:40.500 --> 19:41.270
It's fine.

389
19:41.900 --> 19:44.430
I don't really want to bother him.

390
19:46.700 --> 19:48.700
I've been taking my medicine on time lately,

391
19:48.700 --> 19:50.300
and I'm feeling much better.

392
19:50.790 --> 19:51.500
Really.

393
19:56.290 --> 19:57.000
By the way, Yuan,

394
19:57.000 --> 19:58.640
I have another paper

395
19:59.240 --> 20:00.510
that has already been edited.

396
20:00.510 --> 20:02.660
It should be able to get into a top-tier journal.

397
20:02.660 --> 20:04.590
Since you wrote the algorithm anyway,

398
20:04.590 --> 20:07.250
I was considering listing you as the first author,

399
20:07.250 --> 20:08.660
with Professor Che as corresponding author.

400
20:08.660 --> 20:10.860
That way, you can submit your paper too.

401
20:14.270 --> 20:14.960
No need.

402
20:16.090 --> 20:17.820
Professor Shi agreed to it too.

403
20:22.740 --> 20:23.760
I-It's fine, Yuan.

404
20:23.760 --> 20:25.370
I said "No need"!

405
20:25.920 --> 20:27.350
I know you're excellent.

406
20:28.290 --> 20:29.550
I don't need your help.

407
20:32.590 --> 20:33.200
Do you...

408
20:34.000 --> 20:35.400
also think I can't do it?

409
20:39.250 --> 20:40.460
Are you pitying me?

410
20:45.660 --> 20:46.380
Sorry, Yuan.

411
20:46.380 --> 20:47.010
I...

412
20:48.220 --> 20:49.530
I didn't mean that.

413
20:51.680 --> 20:53.080
I just wanted to help you.

414
20:53.660 --> 20:54.460
Just like...

415
20:55.050 --> 20:55.750
Just like how you helped me

416
20:55.750 --> 20:56.720
when we were kids.

417
20:56.720 --> 20:57.720
I don't need it!

418
21:00.940 --> 21:01.800
I don't need it.

419
21:11.420 --> 21:12.880
I can handle my own affairs

420
21:13.680 --> 21:14.960
by myself.

421
21:16.370 --> 21:17.900
I don't need anyone's pity.

422
22:05.220 --> 22:05.830
Yuan.

423
22:07.410 --> 22:08.330
Hang in there!

424
22:08.920 --> 22:10.500
The ambulance will be here soon.

425
22:10.500 --> 22:11.330
Hold on, Yuan!

426
22:33.830 --> 22:35.720
What exactly happened?

427
22:35.830 --> 22:37.090
How could this happen?

428
22:38.010 --> 22:39.340
What exactly happened?

429
22:40.180 --> 22:41.110
Say something!

430
22:41.610 --> 22:42.160
Uncle,

431
22:44.680 --> 22:45.610
Yuan...

432
22:49.270 --> 22:50.660
Doctor! Doctor!

433
22:50.660 --> 22:51.680
-Doctor! -Doctor!

434
22:51.680 --> 22:52.310
Doctor,

435
22:52.720 --> 22:53.980
how is my son?

436
22:54.070 --> 22:54.740
Please calm down.

437
22:54.740 --> 22:56.740
The doctors are resuscitating him.

438
23:02.240 --> 23:03.030
Fu Shize!

439
23:03.420 --> 23:04.940
Because of his depression,

440
23:04.940 --> 23:06.550
the doctor suggested he take a break from school.

441
23:06.550 --> 23:08.220
You promised us you would take care of him

442
23:08.220 --> 23:09.700
and make sure he would take his medicine properly.

443
23:09.700 --> 23:11.940
That's why we agreed to let him continue his PhD.

444
23:11.940 --> 23:13.670
Is this how you take care of him?

445
23:19.830 --> 23:20.610
I'm sorry.

446
23:20.900 --> 23:22.560
What's the use of being sorry?

447
23:22.940 --> 23:24.880
You never really cared about him!

448
23:25.220 --> 23:27.310
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

449
23:27.880 --> 23:28.810
Get lost!

450
23:30.770 --> 23:31.760
Get lost!

451
23:32.680 --> 23:33.480
Get lost!

452
25:05.420 --> 25:05.900
Yuan.

453
25:08.010 --> 25:09.460
I came to see you.

454
25:12.480 --> 25:14.890
[Tomb of Beloved Son Jiang Yuan]

455
25:52.270 --> 25:54.000
You don't like the rain either,

456
25:55.810 --> 25:56.510
do you?

457
26:11.090 --> 26:11.940
Fu Shize,

458
26:12.210 --> 26:12.910
I'm going to send you

459
26:12.910 --> 26:14.740
the first message.

460
26:19.590 --> 26:21.610
Nice to meet you.

461
26:24.880 --> 26:26.210
Isn't that too robotic?

462
26:26.570 --> 26:27.160
No,

463
26:27.770 --> 26:28.830
this won't work.

464
26:31.530 --> 26:32.740
Nice to meet you.

465
26:32.810 --> 26:35.410
I would appreciate your guidance and support.

466
26:36.610 --> 26:38.830
T-This is too pretentious.

467
26:45.250 --> 26:46.160
Good night.

468
26:49.240 --> 26:52.100
Does anyone say good night for their first message?

469
26:52.440 --> 26:53.370
I don't think so.

470
26:57.380 --> 26:59.240
Send a sticker.

471
27:00.680 --> 27:02.740
There isn't any suitable one either.

472
27:24.090 --> 27:25.350
In the office at night?

473
27:34.640 --> 27:35.240
No way.

474
27:42.730 --> 27:48.450
[You've got a Weixin message.]

475
28:13.220 --> 28:16.480
Who sent me a message so late?

476
28:23.330 --> 28:25.530
Fu Shize took the initiative to message me.

477
28:25.530 --> 28:26.920
Am I dreaming?

478
28:33.450 --> 28:34.950
Be my wife.

479
28:40.680 --> 28:42.080
Recall. Recall. Recall.

480
28:43.720 --> 28:44.810
I can't recall it!

481
28:45.310 --> 28:46.570
How could this happen?

482
28:47.140 --> 28:48.140
What happened?

483
28:55.700 --> 28:59.770
[Two minutes ago]

484
29:11.980 --> 29:13.530
Since things have come to this,

485
29:13.530 --> 29:14.570
let me explain.

486
29:25.770 --> 29:27.200
I pressed it by mistake.

487
29:27.220 --> 29:27.940
Sorry.

488
29:40.010 --> 29:41.270
Yun Li.

489
30:40.570 --> 30:42.790
What does "Mm" mean?

490
30:51.140 --> 30:52.050
Tangy?

491
30:53.070 --> 30:54.590
Why are you here so early?

492
30:54.620 --> 30:55.990
Did you stay up all night?

493
30:55.990 --> 30:57.530
Your dark circles are so heavy.

494
30:57.530 --> 30:59.570
I didn't sleep well last night.

495
31:01.530 --> 31:03.420
Why did you come so early?

496
31:03.680 --> 31:04.540
Did you forget?

497
31:04.570 --> 31:06.230
I said I'd help you move today.

498
31:08.380 --> 31:09.720
Moving today?

499
31:09.720 --> 31:10.420
Yeah.

500
31:16.700 --> 31:17.230
Let's go.

501
31:17.400 --> 31:18.720
Let me recharge you.

502
31:27.800 --> 31:28.930
Where are you going?

503
31:28.940 --> 31:30.000
I'm going to Nanwu.

504
31:30.220 --> 31:31.680
Why are you going to Nanwu?

505
31:32.140 --> 31:33.560
To bring Yun Li back.

506
31:35.240 --> 31:36.830
I know you love your daughter,

507
31:36.830 --> 31:38.570
but she's grown up.

508
31:38.850 --> 31:39.380
You can't always

509
31:39.380 --> 31:40.640
hold her to the standards

510
31:40.640 --> 31:41.640
of a little child.

511
31:42.380 --> 31:43.190
Besides,

512
31:43.210 --> 31:44.180
if you go just like that,

513
31:44.180 --> 31:45.880
are you sure she'll come back with you?

514
31:45.880 --> 31:46.880
If she won't,

515
31:46.880 --> 31:48.680
I'll tie her up and drag her back.

516
31:49.070 --> 31:49.770
Look at you,

517
31:50.140 --> 31:51.570
getting all worked up.

518
31:51.920 --> 31:53.680
If you hadn't been so ill-tempered,

519
31:53.680 --> 31:55.270
would she have stayed away this long?

520
31:55.270 --> 31:57.310
Yun Li has been gone for so many days.

521
31:57.310 --> 31:58.180
As her mother,

522
31:58.180 --> 31:59.810
aren't you worried?

523
32:00.310 --> 32:01.640
Why should I be worried?

524
32:01.880 --> 32:03.180
I trust my daughter.

525
32:03.610 --> 32:04.420
Why?

526
32:04.920 --> 32:05.830
You don't?

527
32:06.130 --> 32:06.780
I...

528
32:06.800 --> 32:08.260
Let's not talk about this.

529
32:08.440 --> 32:09.720
Where are you going?

530
32:10.690 --> 32:11.690
To buy breakfast.

531
32:12.010 --> 32:12.380
Right.

532
32:12.380 --> 32:12.980
Come back!

533
32:16.060 --> 32:17.220
Breakfast is on the table.

534
32:17.220 --> 32:18.620
What are you going to buy?

535
32:22.740 --> 32:24.070
Let me tell you, Yun Ye,

536
32:24.810 --> 32:25.830
don't learn from your sister.

537
32:25.830 --> 32:27.290
You only pick up bad habits!

538
32:27.290 --> 32:27.860
Alright.

539
32:27.880 --> 32:28.580
Hurry up and eat.

540
32:28.580 --> 32:29.540
It'll get cold.

541
32:30.240 --> 32:32.040
Take your dad's luggage inside.

542
32:35.450 --> 32:36.000
I'm telling you,

543
32:36.000 --> 32:37.700
if you take your sister's side again,

544
32:37.700 --> 32:39.640
don't even think about getting pocket money!

545
32:39.640 --> 32:41.440
Time to eat.

546
32:47.500 --> 32:49.220
If Dad treats Li like this,

547
32:49.400 --> 32:51.330
he'll definitely be harsher on me.

548
32:51.980 --> 32:52.510
No way.

549
32:52.830 --> 32:54.160
I need to prepare early.

550
33:01.400 --> 33:02.400
Hello, your food is ready.

551
33:02.400 --> 33:03.050
Thank you.

552
33:11.510 --> 33:12.990
What are you looking at?

553
33:13.220 --> 33:13.950
Give it back.

554
33:16.350 --> 33:17.700
You've grown up,

555
33:17.700 --> 33:18.960
with your own secrets.

556
33:19.030 --> 33:21.360
I don't even know what you were looking at.

557
33:35.790 --> 33:37.330
Wow, look at you.

558
33:37.900 --> 33:39.830
"Be my wife."

559
33:41.440 --> 33:42.750
It's really embarrassing.

560
33:42.750 --> 33:43.160
My...

561
33:43.160 --> 33:44.900
My hand slipped, and I sent it by accident.

562
33:44.900 --> 33:46.590
I think you're sly.

563
33:46.590 --> 33:47.460
My hand really slipped.

564
33:47.460 --> 33:48.750
It was just sent...

565
33:51.000 --> 33:51.290
Tangy,

566
33:51.290 --> 33:52.740
how about we don't move today?

567
33:52.740 --> 33:54.590
It'll be so awkward if we run into him.

568
33:54.590 --> 33:56.450
What's there to be awkward about?

569
33:57.440 --> 33:58.790
It is. I...

570
34:01.330 --> 34:02.190
How about this?

571
34:11.010 --> 34:11.590
Next time you

572
34:11.590 --> 34:12.400
see him,

573
34:12.400 --> 34:13.400
you can say,

574
34:13.610 --> 34:14.650
"Hello, Honey."

575
34:14.650 --> 34:15.300
"Honey."

576
34:15.300 --> 34:15.760
"Honey."

577
34:15.760 --> 34:16.500
"Honey, I'm over here."

578
34:16.500 --> 34:17.150
"Honey."

579
34:17.150 --> 34:17.900
Tang Lin.

580
34:18.050 --> 34:19.440
Be serious.

581
34:19.750 --> 34:20.540
Alright.

582
34:27.040 --> 34:28.860
I almost forgot the real business.

583
34:28.860 --> 34:29.960
Didn't you tell me yesterday

584
34:29.960 --> 34:31.400
that you wanted to find an internship?

585
34:31.400 --> 34:32.460
I found some companies for you.

586
34:32.460 --> 34:33.900
And Xia found some too.

587
34:34.050 --> 34:34.840
I'll send them to you later.

588
34:34.840 --> 34:36.370
Let's take a look together.

589
34:36.590 --> 34:37.000
It seems

590
34:37.000 --> 34:38.340
EAW is also hiring.

591
34:38.400 --> 34:39.840
Why don't you just go there?

592
34:39.840 --> 34:41.360
That way, you'll have an acquaintance looking out for you,

593
34:41.360 --> 34:42.460
including your...

594
34:43.280 --> 34:45.420
honey.

595
34:45.960 --> 34:47.090
I'm not listening.

596
34:47.090 --> 34:47.940
Honey.

597
34:48.280 --> 34:49.820
Honey.

598
35:13.340 --> 35:14.800
Have you thought about it?

599
35:18.470 --> 35:19.670
Are you coming or not?

600
35:19.690 --> 35:21.150
Give me a definite answer.

601
35:21.820 --> 35:22.340
Mm.

602
35:22.900 --> 35:24.360
What does that mean?

603
35:24.760 --> 35:25.960
Are you coming or not?

604
35:29.400 --> 35:31.200
Exactly what you think it means.

605
35:32.550 --> 35:33.860
So you agree, right?

606
35:36.280 --> 35:37.550
I'll take that as a yes!

607
35:46.820 --> 35:48.420
Welcome to the Light Chaser.

608
35:51.260 --> 35:52.400
MLP node

609
35:52.400 --> 35:53.600
connections normal.

610
35:54.500 --> 35:56.230
System self-check completed.

611
35:56.800 --> 35:59.400
You are about to embark on a journey of wonders.

612
36:34.860 --> 36:37.030
Program loading is ready.

613
36:38.320 --> 36:39.710
Ready for departure.

614
36:47.360 --> 36:48.880
Arrived at the destination.

615
36:48.880 --> 36:50.810
Preparing for lunar exploration.

616
38:24.050 --> 38:25.840
I told you not to bring these things.

617
38:25.840 --> 38:27.440
Why did you still bring them?

618
38:27.460 --> 38:28.500
They are all daily necessities.

619
38:28.500 --> 38:29.630
You will always find a use for them.

620
38:29.630 --> 38:30.830
We should save money.

621
38:30.900 --> 38:32.030
Why spend it?

622
38:34.030 --> 38:35.230
Puppy, open the door.

623
38:36.960 --> 38:38.190
Puppy, open the door.

624
38:39.130 --> 38:40.370
Coming! Coming!

625
38:43.910 --> 38:45.510
Who were you calling a puppy?

626
38:46.860 --> 38:47.530
Lili,

627
38:47.530 --> 38:48.330
good morning.

628
38:48.730 --> 38:49.530
Good morning.

629
38:49.630 --> 38:50.300
Is there anyone else here

630
38:50.300 --> 38:51.260
besides you?

631
38:51.260 --> 38:51.980
Be a good boy.

632
38:51.980 --> 38:53.730
Bark for me.

633
38:55.290 --> 38:55.950
Old Auntie,

634
38:55.960 --> 38:57.220
I advise you to be kind.

635
38:57.530 --> 38:58.340
You...

636
38:58.400 --> 38:59.190
You're here.

637
38:59.340 --> 39:00.130
Xia.

638
39:01.030 --> 39:01.730
Let me help you with that.

639
39:01.730 --> 39:02.130
Come on,

640
39:02.130 --> 39:03.460
I'll show you your room.

641
39:03.760 --> 39:04.550
Thank you.

642
39:06.600 --> 39:07.270
Zhengchu,

643
39:07.290 --> 39:08.960
help Tangy with her things too.

644
39:08.960 --> 39:09.480
Okay.

645
39:10.800 --> 39:11.550
Give it to me.

646
39:11.550 --> 39:12.150
No need.

647
39:12.150 --> 39:13.350
I can carry it myself.

648
39:18.030 --> 39:18.840
Move aside.

649
39:25.970 --> 39:26.970
Just give it to me.

650
39:27.050 --> 39:28.000
With your old arms and legs,

651
39:28.000 --> 39:29.000
don't fall later.

652
39:37.360 --> 39:38.620
The room is over there.

653
39:38.840 --> 39:39.930
Make yourself at home.

654
39:39.930 --> 39:41.530
Make yourself comfortable.

655
39:52.090 --> 39:52.760
This conditioner

656
39:52.760 --> 39:54.050
makes your hair really smooth.

657
39:54.050 --> 39:55.440
And this scalp serum

658
39:55.440 --> 39:56.400
works really well too.

659
39:56.400 --> 39:57.360
You can try them.

660
39:57.360 --> 39:58.730
You brought too much.

661
40:02.340 --> 40:03.550
This guesthouse is great,

662
40:03.550 --> 40:04.760
except that it doesn't have a wardrobe.

663
40:04.760 --> 40:06.760
What will you do with all your clothes?

664
40:06.760 --> 40:07.630
As long as I have a place to stay,

665
40:07.630 --> 40:08.800
I don't ask for much.

666
40:08.800 --> 40:09.630
That won't do.

667
40:09.940 --> 40:10.960
How about we go buy one later?

668
40:10.960 --> 40:11.690
No need.

669
40:11.760 --> 40:12.630
I'll just put them there—

670
40:12.630 --> 40:13.110
Lili.

671
40:19.440 --> 40:20.130
Girls have a lot of stuff,

672
40:20.130 --> 40:21.190
so I brought this over for you.

673
40:21.190 --> 40:22.360
Lili, where should I put it?

674
40:22.360 --> 40:22.840
It's fine.

675
40:22.840 --> 40:23.840
Just put it there.

676
40:23.940 --> 40:24.730
Thank you.

677
40:25.630 --> 40:27.230
Call me if you need anything.

678
40:30.800 --> 40:31.590
Right.

679
40:31.590 --> 40:32.590
Congsheng said there's a welcome dinner

680
40:32.590 --> 40:33.190
tonight.

681
40:33.190 --> 40:34.590
We're having a barbecue.

682
40:34.940 --> 40:36.000
You should join us.

683
41:01.500 --> 41:02.030
Uncle.

684
41:02.610 --> 41:03.860
Come eat at the guesthouse tonight.

685
41:03.860 --> 41:04.980
Congsheng is throwing a party.

686
41:04.980 --> 41:06.050
You guys go ahead.

687
41:07.010 --> 41:08.650
Lili is moving in tonight.

688
